[38;2;124;124;124mLet me think about what happens with card 1. Card 1 must be in some box; since a[0m[38;2;124;124;124m= min(A) and a < b < c, card 1 must be in A (the box with the smallest minimum).[0m[38;2;124;124;124mSo a = 1.[0m

